WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.674
[Nobunaga] Power armor mechs
were the Mongols' advantage.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:10.260
It's how they conquered
the Japanese settlements

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.845
of Tsushima and Iki Islands.

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:13.555
After we defeated them,

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:18.518
we took this technological advancement
for ourselves to strengthen our borders.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.355
-[deep, rhythmic drumbeats]
-The ancestors say knowledge is power.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.274
I respectfully disagree.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.234
Power is power.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.695
[grunting]

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:32.532
[Nobunaga] A simple concept
my son cannot seem to grasp.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:38.580
Nobukatsu's defeat to Hattori Hanzo
will be told for generations to come.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.874
A mark my legacy cannot afford.

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.917
[panting]

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.093
[both grunting]

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.436
[slow applause]

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.323
[man] My lord,
what brings you to the training grounds?

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.992
[Nobunaga] Our upcoming
parley with the Iga general.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:18.495
Yasuke and Natsumaru will accompany you.

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:22.749
If I may, that would be a mistake.

00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:26.211
I fear the rest of society
will not accept the… [hesitates]

00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:28.463
…liberties you've taken with our culture.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:32.801
Yasuke has proven to have
a fine military mind in his own right.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:35.595
As good as you, perhaps even better.

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:39.974
How can we ever progress
when our instinct is to recede?

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:44.604
I want the Iga Clan to see a glimpse
of how bright our country's future can be.

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:45.605
[Mitsuhide scoffs]

00:01:45.688 --> 00:01:48.942
My lord, if you continue
to add these outsiders to our ranks,

00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:51.236
your enemies will neither fear
nor respect us.

00:01:51.319 --> 00:01:53.613
Yasuke is not one of us.

00:01:53.696 --> 00:01:55.990
Our people will not accept him.

00:01:56.116 --> 00:02:01.287
I will soon represent the people,
and I will usher them into a new world.

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:03.998
[scoffs]

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.802
He really does not like me.

00:02:16.344 --> 00:02:18.054
Give Mitsuhide time.

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:21.474
Nobunaga puts faith in you
he does not show in others.

00:02:21.558 --> 00:02:23.476
That can rub some the wrong way.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.812
[chuckles] And how does it rub you?

00:02:25.854 --> 00:02:31.025
Nobunaga believes in the&nbsp;Onna Bugeisha.
So, you and I are alike.

00:02:31.568 --> 00:02:32.402
Huh.

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:35.864
It's nothing.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.825
The seal from my family crest,

00:02:38.867 --> 00:02:41.911
given to me by my mother
and her mother before her.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.288
It's honorable.

00:02:43.371 --> 00:02:46.583
The past informs our future.
It shows who we are.

